  "label": "Dehumanizing Metaphor",
  "description": "The meme uses the wild boar as a metaphor for human beings who are perceived as 'disgusting' or 'unacceptable'. This metaphor is dehumanizing because it reduces a person to an animal, implying that their worth or humanity is diminished by their appearance or behavior. This is a common rhetorical device in hate speech and social stigma.",
